{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/77716-god-machine-digital-world","id":77716,"title":"God Machine Digital World","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-23T10:32:51-08:00","id":77716,"title":"God Machine Digital World","content":"So, let's abuse 90s cliche a bit!<br /> <br /> ... the God Machine is a physical being. It does not inhabit an alternate dimension known as 'The God Machine'. It's in the real world.<br /> <br /> That SAID... does the God Machine have a 'net'?<br /> <br /> Do people who get involved in the God Machine ever get digitized and uploaded into some sort of surreal, labyrinthine cthonic OS structure?<br /> <br /> ... they wouldn't be in an alternate dimension, mind, they'd just be digitized!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":762,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","user":"MissMaddy","date":". 02-23-2014, 01:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T10:43:07-08:00","id":77726,"title":"","content":"Oooo interesting.<br /> <br /> The things that come to mind immediately are the virtual adepts in the old world of darkness, Tron (the old movie), the matrix (the first one), and some 90s t.v. shows.<br /> <br /> this gives me some ideas, I'll think about them and maybe edit/post later when I've got more time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","name":"Rixx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T10:51:20-08:00","id":77731,"title":"","content":"It occurs to me you could go a few ways with this...<br /> <br /> 1) The God Machine uses some super 'deep net' for communication. This seems likely to me ; TOR, that sort of thing. The infrastructure already exists in the world so all the God Machine has to do is use it. One wonders if angels... being mechanical beings... could have some sort of incredibly effective method of ID, like 600 character long passwords or something. Demons would of course be able to probably duplicate these security measures. What might they find? What sort of information is posted on these sites -- both the most accessible, and the most hidden?<br /> <br /> 2) The God Machine has some sort of net which goes above and beyond typical internet in some unreal fashion... IE, oWoD 'Digital Net' and shit like that. Some sort of more advanced, spacial, internet 'quasi dimension' that's actually just a big simulation for Angels to teleconferance in or whatever.<br /> <br /> Or, alternately...<br /> <br /> 3) Mostly as per 1 above, but also some elements of 2 - Angels have unique embeds and exploits that allow them to take advantage of the 'net and build 'Electric Palaces' in particularly busy nodes. The net isn't built specifically to allow this, however, this is more something that Numina or Embeds/Exploits do than an innate feature of the internet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T11:43:56-08:00","id":77758,"title":"","content":"Well, here's something that'll really be interesting. I don't think of the God Machine isn't a physical being. The God Machine doesn't have a 'net.<br /> <br /> The God Machine IS the net! <br /> <br /> The God Machine's Infrastructure are like individual servers, all joined together running the God Machine program. So, if you get jacked back in, you can get INSIDE the God Machine. The Labyrinthine OS is running around inside the GM itself, fightin' off hunter angel routines!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T14:18:36-08:00","id":77825,"title":"","content":"I've always thought of the Temenos as a good foundation for a nWoD Digital Web. As is, it will already have realms based on collective understandings and fantasies about cyberspace, and it is also a realm which the God-Machine and Demons have some amount of access (physically!) to. I would consider those Infrastructure locations which are used for teleportation to be viable places for Demons to jack in without even requiring a special ability, and I could also see an Embed which allows projection into the realm for a Demon under the Plugged In condition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/486-foolish-milex","name":"Foolish Milex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar486_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}